 ## Background
-**Origin:**
-The method was introduced by William M. Wooding and others in the late 1980s. The primary source is a paper titled "Display of Surfaces from Volume Data" (CGA 1988) and a related DTIC report "Rendering of Surfaces from Volume Data" (ADA193649) [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
